CubeOS
======

CubeOS is based on [LineageOS](https://github.com/LineageOS) (`lineage-23.2`, Android 16).

Getting started
---------------

To initialize your local repository using the CubeOS trees:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/harryugoji/cubeos_android.git -b cubeos-23.2 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```

Most projects are still fetched from LineageOS. Projects that CubeOS customises
are forked under `harryugoji/cubeos_*` and pointed at their `cubeos-23.2` branch
in this manifest.

Keeping up with LineageOS
-------------------------

The `lineage-23.2` branch tracks upstream unchanged. To pull in upstream changes:
```
git fetch https://github.com/LineageOS/android.git lineage-23.2
git merge FETCH_HEAD
```

Please see the [LineageOS Wiki](https://wiki.lineageos.org/) for per-device build instructions.
